{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q6469021","formula":"C₁₉H₁₅ClF₃NO₇","hill":"C19H15ClF3NO7","elements":["H","C","N","O","F","Cl"],"composition":{"C":19.0,"F":3.0,"H":15.0,"N":1.0,"O":7.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"Lactofen","ru":"Лактофен"},"descriptions":{"en":"Lactofen is a complex ester of acifluorfen and is a nitrophenyl ether selective herbicide and fungicide. It is used in postemergence applications to certain crops which are resistant to its action. The name \"Lactofen\" is approved by the American National Standards Institute and the Weed Science Society of America, and is also approved in China (乳氟禾草灵).","ru":"Лактофен — сложный эфир ацифлуорфена, селективный послевсходовый гербицид. Применяется при выращивании отдельных культур, которые устойчивы к его действию. Лактофен распрыскивается на листья и обычно используется для борьбы с широколиственными сорняками на посевах сои, зерновых культур, картофеля и арахиса."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":62276,"mass":461.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCOC(=O)C(C)OC(=O)C1=C(C=CC(=C1)OC2=C(C=C(C=C2)C(F)(F)F)Cl)[N+](=O)[O-]","inchikey":"CONWAEURSVPLRM-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"(1-ethoxy-1-oxopropan-2-yl) 5-[2-chloro-4-(trifluoromethyl)phenoxy]-2-nitrobenzoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"62276","atoms":46,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.389,"y":2.218,"z":2.985,"el":"Cl"},{"x":5.039,"y":-0.626,"z":-2.048,"el":"F"},{"x":6.198,"y":0.084,"z":-0.357,"el":"F"},{"x":4.83,"y":-1.588,"z":-0.109,"el":"F"},{"x":-1.873,"y":-1.167,"z":-0.082,"el":"O"},{"x":0.76,"y":3.188,"z":0.641,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.163,"y":-4.651,"z":0.337,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.598,"y":-0.529,"z":1.303,"el":"O"},{"x":0.2,"y":-2.87,"z":-0.199,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.644,"y":1.18,"z":-1.84,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.347,"y":1.836,"z":0.134,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.431,"y":1.665,"z":-0.704,"el":